 \"pia.\" matches D4+G3. A falling 16th group matches G4 F4 E4 D4. The barline at the end of the staff closes bar 53. The rest of the staff is empty and crossed out, so bar 54's C4 B3 C4 is not on this line.\n\nWhat doesn't match: the \"pia.\" at the line's start has no counterpart in the edition. The edition's bar 51 has \"poco f\" at its start, which is on the previous line.","right":true,"insights":"The copyist's \"rinf.\" marks line up with the edition's [rf] G4 8th. Bars 50 and 52 are nearly the same, and that marking is what shows the middle bar is 52, not 50. The line ends with a clear barline followed by crossed-out empty staff, so the end was easy to place. The start was harder because the line opens with only the end of bar 51. A clearer view of the previous line's last notes, or the edition listing dynamics for the second half of each bar, would have made the start bar certain."},"ttft_ms":13655,"type":"result","duration_ms":34683,"uuid":"1b144c2f-cc00-4bc1-9f1b-030ad7d9e2e9","ttft_stream_ms":1692,"time_to_request_ms":506,"first_content_frame_ms":1693,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":3139,"cacheReadInputTokens":1046,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10799,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1493972,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2450,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":10799,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
